{"version":1,"content":"<p>張馳豪（Aska）推出新歌《我開始看明呢下》，新歌曲風輕快鬆弛，有別於年初作品《一個人的生日歌》的哀傷，亦不同於《樂活道》的性感狂野，展現出一種放開不再執著，照顧好自己才有氣力繼續探索前路的心態。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T11:20:30.978254+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:32:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T11:57:34.711609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:17:39.517863+00:00","content_hash":"dd8cea363871e04a55954b8c016399ea0b5cc824fb88ad1a8730fe7fc0b4e0a3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}